# Harness WP rules

- Stack is DDEV + WordPress + MariaDB + custom plugin in `1.plugin/harness-plugin`.
- Native only: hooks, REST, `$wpdb`, capabilities, nonces, sanitize/escape.
- No Laravel/Illuminate/Doctrine/Eloquent.
- Mutating REST routes must not use `__return_true` as `permission_callback`.
- Prefer constructor DI via `Core\Container` and `Providers\ServiceProvider`.
